# transparency.dev

[transparency.dev](https://transparency.dev/) is a substantial and significant free and open-source software project maintaining public witness network infrastructure for tamper-evident logs and related software suite for building end-to-end transparency ecosystems.

### Project Liaisons

* Patrick Flynn
* Bob Callaway

### Services

* Transfer, registration, holding and protection of intangible assets including trademarks and domain names
* Legal ownership of code repository, social media and community service accounts
* Project operations vendor contract management including contracting with external suppliers for community coordination and managing contracts for Transparency.dev Summit
* Financial administration including accepting donations, holding funds, processing outgoing payments and reimbursements, and financial reporting.
